	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_1137920" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_1137921"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_1137922" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>ELECTION OF HISD BOARD OF EDUCATION&nbsp;TRUSTEES</strong></p>

<p>An election will be held in&nbsp;the&nbsp;Houston Independent School District on November 2, 2027, to&nbsp;elect&nbsp;a trustee&nbsp;from each of the following four districts:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Geographic District II held by Savant Moore</li>
	<li>Geographic District III held by Dani Hernandez</li>
	<li>Geographic District IV held by Dr. Patricia Allen</li>
	<li>Geographic District VIII held by Pl&aacute;cido G&oacute;mez</li>
</ul>

<p>Candidates and voters may consult the resources linked on the right side of this page for election information and related materials.</p>

<p>For additional assistance please contact the Board Services Department at <a href="mailto:Boardservices@houstonisd.org" target="_blank">BoardServices@HoustonISD.org</a>.</p>


	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	
