	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_1073496" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_1073496"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_1073496' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-1073496'>2025 Trustee Election</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-1073496"></a>
	<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_1115808" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_1115809"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_1115811" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>An election was held in the Houston Independent School District on November 4, 2025, to elect&nbsp;trustees from Geographic Districts V, VI, and VII. Candidates for Geographic Districts I and IX were unopposed so their names did not appear on the ballot.</p>

<p>The following are the newly elected or re-elected trustees:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Geographic District I - Felicity Pereyra (new)</li>
	<li>Geographic District V - Maria Benzon (new)</li>
	<li>Geographic District VI - Michael McDonough (new)</li>
	<li>Geographic District VII - Bridget Wade (incumbent)</li>
	<li>Geographic District IX - Myrna Guidry (incumbent)</li>
</ul>


	</div>


	</div>
	
