		<a id="fs-panel-1117711"></a>
	<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_1117713" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p><a class="button-4 button-expand" data-file-name="2024bondelectionnotice_english.pdf" data-resource-uuid="da3dffd6-215b-4f65-b434-0115dba90593" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/da3dffd6-215b-4f65-b434-0115dba90593" target="_blank" title="HOUSTON INDEPENDENT SCHOOL DISTRICT NOVEMBER 5, 2024, BOND ELECTION">HOUSTON INDEPENDENT SCHOOL DISTRICT NOVEMBER 5, 2024, BOND ELECTION</a><br />
