	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_1118486" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_1118486"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_1118486' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-1118486'>Practice</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-1118486"></a>
	<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_1118488" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>The issuance of $440,000,000 schoolhouse bonds by Houston Independent School District for technology equipment and systems, technology infrastructure, instruction technology and the imposition of taxes sufficient to pay the principal of and interest on the bonds and the costs of any credit agreements executed in connection with the bonds. This is a property tax increase.</p>

<ul style="margin-left: 40px;">
	<li><a class="button-arrow" data-file-name="voterinformationdocumentpropositionaenglish.pdf" data-resource-uuid="22f97927-acb2-4c3c-b493-5d948beb9509" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/22f97927-acb2-4c3c-b493-5d948beb9509" target="_blank">English</a></li>
	<li><a class="button-arrow" data-file-name="voterinformationdocumentpropositionaspanish.pdf" data-resource-uuid="79e7a740-406d-47bd-bd29-415fa5492f01" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/79e7a740-406d-47bd-bd29-415fa5492f01" target="_blank">Spanish</a></li>
	<li><a class="button-arrow" data-file-name="voterinformationdocumentpropositionachinese.pdf" data-resource-uuid="b2c39114-3c21-4c14-b132-518b5b5d6c0c" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/b2c39114-3c21-4c14-b132-518b5b5d6c0c" target="_blank">Chinese</a></li>
	<li><a class="button-arrow" data-file-name="voterinformationdocumentpropositionavietnamese.pdf" data-resource-uuid="330a6df3-7193-4e6a-8378-dde90099d735" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/330a6df3-7193-4e6a-8378-dde90099d735" target="_blank">Vietnamese</a></li>
</ul>


