	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_1073500" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_1073500"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_1073500' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-1073500'>2023 Trustee Election</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-1073500"></a>
	<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_1115858" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_1115859"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_1115861" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>An election was held in the Houston Independent School District on November 7, 2023, to elect&nbsp;trustees from Geographic Districts III and IV. Candidates for Geographic Districts II and VIII were unopposed so their names did not appear on the ballot.</p>

<p>The following are the newly elected or re-elected trustees:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Geographic District II - H. A. &quot;Savant&quot; Moore&nbsp;(new)</li>
	<li>Geographic District III - Dani Hernandez (incumbent)</li>
	<li>Geographic District IV&nbsp;- Patricia K. Allen (incumbent)</li>
	<li>Geographic District VIII - Pl&aacute;cido G&oacute;mez (new)</li>
</ul>


	</div>


	</div>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_1115863" data-use-new="true" >

